    <td align=left bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>&nbsp;1&nbsp;</font></td>
    <td width=75% bgcolor="#6E94B7"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><b>&nbsp;Members and Friends / EoD Raids / <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=6;action=display;num=1038238908;start=3"><font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2><u>Re: PoP?</u></font></a></b></font></td>
    <td align=right bgcolor="#6E94B7"><nobr>&nbsp;<font class="text1" color="#FFFFFF" size=2>on: Dec 12<sup>th</sup>, 2002, 8:35pm&nbsp;</font></nobr></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF" class="catbg"><font class="catbg" size=2>Started by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=Drakle" alt="View Profile: radnaxvovov">Drakle</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?action=viewprofile;username=radnaxvovov" alt="View Profile: radnaxvovov">radnaxvovov</a></font></td>
  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>PoD is one of the tougher of the 4 IMO. PoI is pretty easy, PoJ has lite blue mobs at 58 but I haven't hunted there so can't tell ya what the mobs are like. PoN has 2 seperate areas. Top of the cliff easier/bottom of cliff harder. PoD has some easy spots like tsetse flies but then has some pretty tough mobs not far away like Malarians. Personally I recommend your group be 55+ to be really effective here. You can be lower level but expect downtime because the mobs hit in the 250-400 range depending on what you're fighting. They don't always hit that hard of course and slow is almost a must. There are alot of places in these zones that your puller can pull singles with no problem if they are careful and use ranged items. Just pay attention to the pathing of the mobs and realize they have a pretty sizeable aggro range in most areas. &nbsp;<br> &nbsp;<br> P.S. 55+ PoP is prolly the best exp in the game from what I've seen. Of course I started in it at 56ish so couldn't tell you what it was like before 55. </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
<a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=6;action=post;num=1038238908;start=3;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/reply.gif" alt="Reply" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Reply</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=6;action=post;num=1038238908;quote=3;title=Post+reply"><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/quote.gif" alt="Quote" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgwindowbg">Quote</font></a> <a href="http://www.eq-eod.com/cgi-bin/yabb/YaBB.pl?board=6;action=notify;thread=1038238908;start="><img src="http://www.eq-eod.com/YaBBImages/notify.gif" alt="Notify of replies" border="0"> <font size="1" class="imgcatbg">Notify of replies</font></a>
